        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu mwaka ugira mirongwibiri umwami Aritazeruzi ari ku ngoma, mu kwezi kwa Nisani, umusi ur’ izina vino yar’ iteretse imbere y’umwami, maze ndayābira, ndayimuhēreza. Kandi sinaribgagire umubabaro nd’ imbere yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami arambaza, ati Mbega k’ubabaye, wiraburaniwe mu maso, kand’ utarwaye? Ivyo ntibiterwa n’ikindi, atar’ umubabaro wo mu mutima. Ndaheza ngira ubgoba bginshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
