              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami arambaza, ati Non’ ugomba iki? Nca nsenga Imana Nyen’ ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nishura umwami, nti Ni wabishima ga mugenzi, nkagira ubutoni imbere yawe, ico ngusaba n’ukugira ng’ undungike i Buyuda, mu gisagara kirimw’ imva za ba sogokuruza, nsubire ndacubake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umwami yar’ avyagiye ngaho ari kumwe n’umwamikazi wiwe; nukw arambaza, at’ Urugendo rwawe ruzoba urw’ imisi ingahe kand’ uzogaruka ryari? Nuk’ umwami yemera kundekura, nanje nca ndamubgira igihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.8.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 8:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaheza ndamubarira, nti Ni wabishima ga mugenzi, mpabge ivyete nshīra ivyēgēra vyawe vyo hakurya y’ uruzi, kugira ngo bemere kumpa inzira nshike i Buyuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bo n’ icete nshira Asafu, umurinzi arinda icibare cawe, kugira ngw ampe ibiti vyo kubāza ibikingi vy’amarembo y’igihome c’abashibamyi co ku ngoro, bo n’ivy’ uruzitiro rw’igisagara n’ivy’ inzu nzobamwo. Nuk’ umwami arabinyemerera, abitewe n’ikiganza ciza c’Imana cari kuri jewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
