        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndababarira, nti Mbega ntimubona ayo twabonye, ingen’ i Yerusalemu hahindutse imisaka, n’amarembo yaho akaba yarahīye! Enda ni muze dusubire twubake uruzitiro rwaho, kugira ngo twoye kwama tur’ agatwengo. ",
          "type": "text",
